      "telemetryExecutionIds": [
        "EXE-20260911T154246574Z-2ea3c900"
      ],
      "completedAt": "2026-09-11T15:45:27.000Z",
      "conclusion": "Spike D context-cost half run with its own harness, since ROS telemetry reports token capabilities as unsupported here. 46x-101x context reduction at 200 tables, 2.4x at 4 tables: raw context is O(schema size), a Strata point query is O(1). HY-STRATA-2026-1E5D moves to supported at medium confidence, held at medium because the baseline assumes an agent reads the whole schema rather than grepping selectively. Secondary finding: the scope-and-caveats block is larger than the result for point queries and is repeated verbatim per answer; emitting it once per session would cut a multi-query session by roughly two thirds. The correctness half (HY-STRATA-2026-2A6F) was NOT run - no agents were executed - and is recorded as untested."
    },
